    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Shibi sha Samalia na Yelusalemu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mhayo go ng'wa SEEBA gūkanizīīla: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'wana wa munhū, baalīho bakīma babīlī, ba kūfuma mu nda īmò; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bakaja Misili būūkabiza bamalahya, bifunya kū wīīmīlīzu kwandīja shikū ja ha būdo wabo. Ū mu sī yenīyo ī ndutu jabo jūyikala jikūdimagūlagwa, ī mbeele ja ha būnya wabo jūyūbbaabbaashiwa sagala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ntaale witanagwa Ohola, ū nzunaye Oholiba. A benabo baalī bane, nīyo baalī baanibyalīla na baana bagosha na bakīma. Ū Ohola ng'wene Samalia, ū Oholiba Yelusalemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Ohola aho alandya ū būmalahya walī ataalī wane; ūyikala wabikūmbagwa bashihya bakwe, bana Ashulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baalī bashilikale, ba shizwalo sha langi ya būlulu, basugi ba sī na (makalwe) bataale ba mabità ga būlūgū; pye baalī basūmba banyalaali, badamhīji ba falasa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akifunya būmalahya ū kū Baashulu pye a bose a bakūjiwa, ūyisosohaja mu nzīla ya shiikolile sha kūlamiwa sha ng'wa ose ose ūyo ūng'wikūmvwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū būmalahya ūbo olī owandya Misili atalekanile nabo, ūbo owītaga mu shikū ja ha būdo bokwe, mu shikū jene bagosha balaalaga nang'hwe; nī mbeele ja ha būnya bokwe būyūjibbaabbaasha, kūnū bakūnsosohajaga na būsoso bo kwikūmvwa kwabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakaneka mu makono ga bashihya bakwe, a Baashulu abo walī abikūmbilwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būnzuuja ī shizwalo būneka alī dūūhū, na a baana bakwe bagosha na bakīma, būng'wīngīja; bīīta būmūlaga ū wei bo līlūshū. Akagūpandīka ū nsango gwakwe ūbiza lūsumo ū mu bakīma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ng'wanong'wawe ū Oholiba akībona ī yenīyī, alīyo kūlwa kwikūmvwa kwa būmalahya bokwe, ū wei h'akabiza na soso nhaale no kūtinda ū nkūlūye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nū wei ūbikūmvwa a Baashulu, a basugi ba sī na a bataale ba mabità ga būlūgū, baalī bashilikale mu shizwalo shabo sha būlūgū; pye basūmba banyalaali, badamhīji ba falasa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakabona gīkī nang'hwe wasosohala; bose būbīlī wabo būbiza badima nzīla īmò.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike ū wei akongeja no ū mu būmalahya bokwe, nguno akabona sanamu ja banhū joolilwe ha ndugu; Bakalidayo balī mu shizwalo shaza ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na mishipi ū mu mikīmbīlī, na shikoye sha būlenji ū kū mitwe yabo. Pye a bose baali gītī bashilikale ba magogoteni ga būlūgū ga bana Babuloni, bajigajiga ba sī ya Būkalidayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho wajibona ī sanamu jenījo ūbikūmvwa a Bakalidayo, ūtūma nhūng'wa ū kū sī yabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna a bana Babuloni benabo biza ng'hana, būlaala nang'hwe mu būlīīlī, būnsosohaja na būsoso wa kwikūmvwa kwabo. Aho bansosohaja gīko kwimanīla ogalūka, ūbabbyeda ūbaleka obakolagwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho akwītaga ī mihayo yakwe ya būmalahya mu būbi būtaale hape hape, nakambyeda no nūgalūka nūneka kūlwa kūnkolwa, gīt'ūmò nakagalūkīla nūneka dūhū nū nkūlūye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike akongeja ū mu būmalahya wakwe, nguno akajiizūkwa ī shikū ja ha būdo bokwe, a makanza gene alī mu sī ya Misili akūkoolanaga na mihayo ya būmalahya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nīyo aho alī kwenūko walī abikūmbilwe no a bagosha abo washihyaga nabo, abo mīlī gwabo gwa nyagosha gwalī gūtikīlile na gwa nzobe, īsho shabafumaga shalī gītī sha falasa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "H'ūmo ūkalūkūmbūlīla ū lūhya lwako lwa ha būdo, aho mbeele jako jiikalaga jikūbbaabbaashiagwa, nī ndutu jako jiikalaga jikūdimagūlagwa aho jitaalī ndo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alilūūlū bebe Oholiba, Ū SEEBA MULUNGU alīhaya gīkī, Abo washihyaga nabo, abo ūkababbyeda ūgalūka ūbaleka obakolwa, nakūbasamīlīja bakūsange kūfuma mhandī jose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakwiza banhū ba kūfuma Babuloni, na a Bakalidayo pye a bose; bagosha ba sī ja Pekoda, Shoa, na Koa. A Baashulu nabo bakūbiza hamò nabo pye a bose; basūmba banyalaali, pye basugi ba sī na bataale ba mabità ga būlūgū, bataale ba magogoteni ga būlūgū, na bakūjiwa mu mabità ga bashilikale; pye bakwiza badamhīlile falasa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakūkūsanga bal'ibità itaale lya banhū bingī na magogoteni ga būlūgū, na ga kūbūūkīja miligo. Bakūshika bīme ng'hīga ng'hīga bakūnyame būlī kwene, bakwiza babūkije shilanga shabo na mūda nhaale na ndo, bazwalile mahima ga chūma. Nakūkūtūūla mu makono gabo bakwinhe nsango gwa kūlenganīla na kalamulīle kabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū būpelanu bone nakūbūlogeja kūlī bebe, nīyo bakūkwītīla ī mihayo mu būkalī būtaale no. Bakūyūgatīna a mūūlū na a matū ga banhū bako; hama abo balasaage bakūshilīla mu būlūgū. A baana bako a bagosha na a bakīma bakūbasola; a bangī abo balasaage bakūkenaagūlwa bo moto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nī shizwalo shako bakūkūzuuja bashijane, nū būlenji wako pyī ū bose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu gīko nakūlūmala ū lūhya lwako nū būmalahya wako ūbo ūkiza nabo kūfuma Misili. Hūna ūtūshiikūmvwa hangī ī shikolo shenīshi, nūūlū ī Misisli ūtūkūmbūla koi hangī.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ū Seeba MULUNGU alīhaya gīkī, Nalī hihī kūkūtūūla mu makono ga banhū abo batakūtogilwe, abo ūkababbyeda ūgalūka ūbaleka obakolagwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakūkwītīla mu kūkūkolwa kūtaale, na bakūkwīngīja pyī ī shikolo shako īsho washinoga nogela. Bakūkūleka ūlī dūūhū, nīyo ūlī makono dalali, ī minala ya būmalahya wako yitendaga hape. Ū lūhya lwako nū būmalahya wako ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "h'īsho shakwenhelegije mihayo īlī gīko; nguno ya kūgikūmvwa mahanga, na kwisosohaja bebe kūlwa shiikolile shaago sha kūlamiwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Īkī wasolile nzīla ya nkūlūyo, nū nene nakūkūtūūlīla mu nkono gwako ī shikombe shakwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Seeba MULUNGU alīhaya gīkī,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alilūūlū ū Seeba MULUNGU alīhaya gīkī, Īkī ū nene wanīība ūniponya kū numa yako, ūkūgūbūūcha ū nsango gwa lūhya na būmalahya wako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA ūniwīla gīkī, “Ng'wana wa munhū, ūmalīīlile ū kūnamula ū Ohola nū Oholiba? Boolekejage pyī ī shītīle shabo sh'ipelanya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno bashihani a benabo, na a makono gabo gadabbalanhile mininga; bakashihyaga na mashiikolile gabo ga kūlamiwa. Nīyo na a baana babo abo baanibyalīla nene bakabafunyaga shitambò sha kūgalyisha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A higūlya ya yenīyo ū nene ng'wenekīlī baanīītīla īyī: Ī lipandī lyane lyeela baalīsosohaja, nī sabato jane būjisosohaja ng'wikanza līmò lyenīlo dūhū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu lūshikū lwene baababafunyaga shitambò baana babo kū mashiikolile gabo ga kūlamiwa, bakingīla ū ng'wipandī lyane lyeela būūkalīsosohaja; h'ūmo bakīītīla ū mu numba yane.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.39"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nīyo bakatūma na nhūng'wa kū bagosha ba kūle gīkī bize; aho biza, ū bebe ūkooga kūlwa nguno yabo, wibila na wanja kū miso, witūūlīla na būlenji wako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna wigasha h'isumbī ly'ikūjo, na meza īgolanije a ha būtongi walyo; ūtūūla ho būbbani na maguta, ī shose shenīsho shane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hama walī apīndiwe yoge ya banhū baayombagīlaga mihayo ītī y'ikūjo; baalī benhwa na Basabena kūfuma kū sī y'itogolo. Na bagosha bangī ba sagala baalī basolelejiwa benhwa; būyūnzwalīkīja bangili mu nkono ū nkīma ng'wenūyo nū ng'wanong'wawe, nū kū mitwe yabo mahima masoga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niwīla nakūng'hayaga ūyo walī wagoobbeejiwa būmalahya: A benaba bakūlaala nang'hwe nū ng'wenūyū ūmo alī ng'wenūmu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'hana būlaala nang'hwe ūmo jilī nhūngwa ja bamalahya; h'ūmo bakaīla nū kū ba Ohola na Oholiba, a bakīma a bīmīlīzu benabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo a banhū a batūngīlīja bakūbabalīla nsango ūyo gūbigeleelilwe bakīma bashihani na babūlagi ba banhū, nguno ng'hana bashihani, na a makono gabo gadabbalanhile mininga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.45"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Seeba MULUNGU alīhaya gīkī, Benhelagi ibità lya banhū liize kūbadetemya lībataaje nī shikolo shabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī lībità lyenīlo līkūyūbatūla mawe na kūbamala bo shū, na kūbabūlaga a baana babo bagosha na bakīma, nī numba jabo lījitiime moto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu gīko nakūlūmala ū lūhya ū mu sī; pye a bakīma bakwilanga, batizīta ūmo mukwītīlaga a bing'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nīyo ū lūhya lwing'we lūkūng'wenhela makoye no, mukūgūbūūcha ū nsango ūyo gūlamugwīle kūlwa shibi shing'we sha kūlamya shiikolile. Hūna mukūdeeba gīkī ū nene nalī Seeba MULUNGU.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.49"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
